{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">SAMUKID is the story of a child traveling with a blind companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become the protagonist of a legendary journey with your eccentric yet strong partner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/d5d2c5b8f9672c4e860e003aac5a326c.avif?t=1759053799\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/5e1a9108000d7fa84c571563c83fdded.poster.avif?t=1759053799\" width=996 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/5e1a9108000d7fa84c571563c83fdded.webm?t=1759053799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/5e1a9108000d7fa84c571563c83fdded.mp4?t=1759053799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Complete your own unique combat style by collecting loot and acquiring and enhancing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Move the child to carry your blind companion, engaging in strategic battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Utilize the powerful synergy between skills and loot to defeat the final boss and prove your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/264157e6f42fa5ecbc4b6ce3a38a418d.avif?t=1759053799\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/a8a9aa5b360470b5adecc7f236cf7091.poster.avif?t=1759053799\" width=996 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/a8a9aa5b360470b5adecc7f236cf7091.webm?t=1759053799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/a8a9aa5b360470b5adecc7f236cf7091.mp4?t=1759053799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow through diverse events and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enhance your strategic synergy with loot and gold obtained from defeating monsters, secure necessary items through trading, or strengthen your party further by recruiting powerful companions through special events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Complete your own strategy and experience new battles every time through the combination of skills, loot, companions, and your choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/d0876bb351a5f6d67a6384a69c1d6c02.avif?t=1759053799\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/d1c3d2f67de93231c9a9659cf3b27f73.poster.avif?t=1759053799\" width=996 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/d1c3d2f67de93231c9a9659cf3b27f73.webm?t=1759053799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/d1c3d2f67de93231c9a9659cf3b27f73.mp4?t=1759053799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose characters with unique skills and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bosses and regions with new abilities await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enjoy combat in a constantly new and diverse environment through the combination of characters, bosses, and regions!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876950?t=1759053799","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876950?t=1759053799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/3b72cb5453da7bd72dba96cfbc53d79ad4a017e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759053799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/3b72cb5453da7bd72dba96cfbc53d79ad4a017e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759053799","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3917540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">SAMUKID is the story of a child traveling with a blind companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become the protagonist of a legendary journey with your eccentric yet strong partner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/d5d2c5b8f9672c4e860e003aac5a326c.avif?t=1759053799\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/5e1a9108000d7fa84c571563c83fdded.poster.avif?t=1759053799\" width=996 height=562 ><source src=\"h