y further by recruiting powerful companions through special events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Complete your own strategy and experience new battles every time through the combination of skills, loot, companions, and your choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/d0876bb351a5f6d67a6384a69c1d6c02.avif?t=1759053799\" width=1280 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/d1c3d2f67de93231c9a9659cf3b27f73.poster.avif?t=1759053799\" width=996 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/d1c3d2f67de93231c9a9659cf3b27f73.webm?t=1759053799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/d1c3d2f67de93231c9a9659cf3b27f73.mp4?t=1759053799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose characters with unique skills and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bosses and regions with new abilities await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enjoy combat in a constantly new and diverse environment through the combination of characters, bosses, and regions!</p>","developers":["ArmedPeseant"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/d513c3ca881706064d78b10bd20852983cc2a777/header.jpg?t=1759053799","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"d